WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Oh Light, have mercy...

2
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
I'm afraid, the Light won't help us here... What is this?

3
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.000
This is Locus.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Here matter acquires shape and becomes a part of the whole.

5
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Perfectness is order. Order is wholeness.

6
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.000
If you disrupt Locus' wholeness, you will disrupt the harmony of the world...

7
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:59.000
No time for philosophy! We have to stop him!

8
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:07.000
You? This is pointless. You cannot break such a perfect structure.

9
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Unless... You destroy matter! Destroy the Inferiors! Then the existence of Locus will lose its meaning.

10
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:23.000
We... I... The whole is calling for me. Don't count on my help.

11
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.000
We'll get along somehow...

12
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:33.000
Children of chaos... Why did you come to my world? I am the Architect! I am the Order!

13
00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.000
You are going to ascend. Become perfect. Become whole... as well as our loose shard!
